    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Abyssborne</strong> is a dark fantasy roguelite</h2><strong>Abyssborne</strong> thrusts you into a shadowed, ever-changing dungeon, teeming with enemies, upgrades, and untold power.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/2dfe615a3f4027a04cbdcd759dc78e3c.poster.avif?t=1750236198\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/2dfe615a3f4027a04cbdcd759dc78e3c.webm?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/2dfe615a3f4027a04cbdcd759dc78e3c.mp4?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Dynamic Combat</h2>Engage in fast-paced, reactive combat where every strike matters. Face a wide variety of unique enemies and grow stronger with each battle.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/897aa080b1866a2095438e3d87965d04.poster.avif?t=1750236198\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/897aa080b1866a2095438e3d87965d04.webm?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/897aa080b1866a2095438e3d87965d04.mp4?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger with Every Step</h2>Progress through the ever-changing dungeon, unlock new abilities, and evolve your playstyle. Each run brings you closer to mastering the darkness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/24afbe9a9543c7d83d47725bdd6222b4.poster.avif?t=1750236198\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/24afbe9a9543c7d83d47725bdd6222b4.webm?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/24afbe9a9543c7d83d47725bdd6222b4.mp4?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover the Secrets of the Abyss</h2>Progress deeper into the dungeon to piece together the cryptic story. Discover hidden letters and uncover the dark mysteries buried within the Abyss.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/ebf4d974d3d5f42ced76f98cf8fcd444.poster.avif?t=1750236198\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/ebf4d974d3d5f42ced76f98cf8fcd444.webm?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781190/extras/ebf4d974d3d5f42ced76f98cf8fcd444.mp4?t=1750236198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
